'''Onodones''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]]<ref name="Alien Archive" /> [[elephantine]]<ref name="Holocron" /> [[species]] distinguished by the trunk-like [[mouth]]s, some long enough to be draped over and behind their shoulders and down their torsos. They were rarely seen and often missing from [[The galaxy|galactic]] events, obscuring details about this unusual species, their history, and their [[homeworld]],<ref name="Alien Archive" /> although they perhaps originated in the [[Unknown Regions]].<ref name="USW New Edition">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref>

[[Gwellis Bagnoro]] was a mysterious Onodone who was very secretive about his past and an expert [[Forger (profession)|forger]].<ref name="Alien Archive" /> Bagnoro spent [[time]] at the [[Takodana Castle|castle]] of the [[pirate]] [[Maz Kanata]], on the [[planet]] [[Takodana]].<ref name="TFAVD" />

